cards Owner cards

box alice as Alice
box bob as Bob
box bank as Bank [mark: Booked]

item c1 as Note #1 in alice, bank [amount: 500 USDC, mark: bank]

step Hand over
  say Writing the item line of an existing card again moves it to those columns.
  alice -> c1: Hand over
  item c1 in bob, bank

step Refuse
  say refuse shows a refused panel with the reason and changes nothing.
  bob -> c1: Again
  refuse c1: Already handed over

step Replace
  say delete strikes a card through and keeps it, and an item line in a step makes a card.
  delete c1
  item c2 as Note #2 in bob, bank [amount: 500 USDC, mark: bank]
